                "**Credentials**: an API token (Profile → API tokens) as the password or as the user name with an empty password, or as a Bearer token (NuGet: as the API key; Cargo and `gem push`: the token alone; Bundler: the user name and token, or the token alone; conda: in `~/.netrc`; micromamba and pixi: as a Bearer token in their auth files; Conan: `conan remote login` with the token as the password; see [Use a token](api-tokens.html#use-a-token)). Public spaces need none while anonymous access is on.",
