            P("A proxy repository of pypi.org (preset **Python Package Index**, `https://pypi.org/simple`) or another index (devpi, Artifactory, Nexus: give its `…/simple` address) fetches each project's page and files when they're first asked for and keeps them. Every file is checked against the hash the index gives. Files are only fetched from the index's own server, or for pypi.org from files.pythonhosted.org; links elsewhere are refused, and the upstream's credentials are never sent to another server. A proxy can also proxy a PyPI repository of another Depotex ([Depotex link](upstreams.html#depotex-link))."),
